bers. User is on `/settings/members`.\n2142:- **Initial state**: Workspace has 3 members. User is on `/settings/members`.\n2149:- **Initial state**: User is on `/settings/members`.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G99XZVNWL8FKyKPtBkLQGz","session_id":"9ab25009-980f-40f8-a022-3d9ee277d1c2","uuid":"1cdda4ed-8ea2-40ed-8d8e-0c2e9176ae5e"}
