"My Workspace\".\n- **Action**: User changes the workspace name field to \"Changed Name\" but navigates away without saving (e.g., clicks \"My Issues\" in sidebar)\n- **Expected**: The workspace name remains \"My Workspace\" (unsaved changes are discarded). Returning to `/settings` shows the original name.\n\n#### Test: Settings page shows appropriate heading and layout\n- **Initial state**: User navigates to `/settings`\n- **Expected**: The page has a clear \"Settings\" heading. The workspace name field and default team dropdown are displayed in a clean form layout consistent with the app's dark theme. Fields have labels clearly indicating their purpose.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G99XZVNWL8FKyKPtBkLQGz","session_id":"9ab25009-980f-40f8-a022-3d9ee277d1c2","uuid":"dab591be-9416-421b-a342-f09fd375983a"}
