splay \"Default team for new issues\" dropdown\n- Clear \"Settings\" page heading\n- Consistent dark theme layout with proper labels\n\n**Edit Workspace Name:**\n- Change workspace name and save (success confirmation toast/inline message)\n- Sidebar workspace header updates in real-time\n- Validation prevents saving empty workspace name (shows error message)\n- Changes persist to database after navigation away and back\n- Can cancel edits by navigating away without saving\n\n**Default Team for New Issues:**\n- Dropdown shows all available teams\n- Can change selection and save (success confirmation)\n- Change affects the team selector default in Create Issue modal\n- Persists after page navigation\n\n**Navigation:**\n- Accessible from sidebar Settings link (`/settings`)\n- Route: `/settings`\n\n### 3. **Directory Structure**\n\n**Pages** (/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/ - 12 pages):\n- ActiveCycle.tsx\n- Inbox.tsx\n- IssueDetail.tsx\n- Labels.tsx\n- Login.tsx\n- Members.tsx\n- MyIssues.tsx\n- ProjectDetail.tsx\n- Projects.tsx\n- SignUp.tsx\n- TeamIssues.tsx\n- Teams.tsx\n- **Missing: Settings.tsx** (needs to be created)\n\n**Components** (/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ - 40+ components):\n- Core: LoginForm, SignUpForm, Sidebar, SidebarCollapse\n- Issues: IssueRow, IssueHeader, IssueDescription, IssueSidebar, ActivityComments, SubIssues\n- Team: TeamCard, TeamSettings, TeamFilters, TeamIssuesList\n- Project: ProjectCard, ProjectFilters, ProjectHeader, ProjectIssuesTab, ProjectOverviewTab\n- Create/Manage: CreateIssueForm, CreateIssueModal, CreateLabel, CreateTeamModal, CreateCycle\n- Lists: MyIssuesList, NotificationList, NotificationRow, LabelList, MemberList, CycleList\n- Other: BulkActions, GroupBySort, FiltersToolbar, KeyboardShortcuts\n- **Note: No WorkspaceSettings component exists yet**\n\n**Redux Slices** (/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/ - 13 slices):\n- authSlice.ts\n- cyclesSlice.ts\n- issueDetailSlice.ts\n- issuesSlice.ts\n- labelsSlice.ts\n- 